abstract: >-
  A curated and source-traceable database of 300 pump aggregate
  configurations for autonomous photovoltaic water-supply systems.
  The inventory-grade release contains normalized pump, electrical-drive,
  hydraulic-curve, source-provenance, and quality-assurance information.
  Hydraulic verification remains incomplete and is explicitly documented
  through verification-status fields.

keywords:
  - photovoltaic water pumping
  - pump aggregates
  - equipment database
  - hydraulic performance curves
  - source traceability
  - quality assurance
  - autonomous water supply

